      "description": "<p>The rod’s tentacles hold you: you take 3d6 Psychic damage at the start of each of your turns, and you repeat the DC 15 Dexterity saving throw at the end of each of your turns, ending the effect on a success. The effect also ends if the rod’s wielder has the Incapacitated condition or takes a Bonus Action to release you, or if you are no longer within 15 feet of the wielder.</p>",
